/*/{Protheus.doc} setModel
Monta o modelo de Nao Conformidades (SAG), entidade unica sem
sub-modelos -- QIEA040.PRW so usa AddFields("SAGMASTER") obrigatorio,
sem AddGrid. Registra NonconformitiesEvents para os bloqueios de
alteracao/exclusao (Q040TudOk/A040ValNco).
@type method
@author willian.ramalho
@since 18/08/2026
/*/
method setModel() class NonconformitiesModel
    Local oEvents as object
    Local oObject as object

    oObject := ObjectFromMetadata():new("SAG")
    ::setObject(oObject:getObject(), "SAG")

    oEvents := NonconformitiesEvents():new()
    ::setEvents(oEvents)
return
